Package: paladin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: project-based IDE for writing V\OS applications
 Paladin is a simple project-based IDE: it keeps source groups, build
 options and run settings per project, drives the build, parses compiler
 errors back into the editor view and launches the result.
